<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan has halted trade at two Iran crossings, affecting the Zangali checkpost and Torkham operations, while Iran-Pakistan trade partially resumes amid a persistent truck backlog. Afghanistan’s border crossing exports have risen 50 percent, and traffic at the Afghanistan-Iran border has doubled after 24‑hour operations began, but Pakistan accuses the Taliban of using Afghan soil for attacks and rejects Taliban claims of civilian casualties from Pakistani strikes. The Taliban-run Afghan government faces international pressure over counter-terrorism failures, and the CSTO is delivering military equipment to Tajikistan to reinforce the Afghan border. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/26/saudi-pakistani-turkish-delegation-iran-avert-flare-up-conflict-us&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFB5cmFRdHYxUjlhTDlIZ1laSTk1a21DUzVlcTBLQUpTY0NuY01XOU5DS21QUENDaGRWalBsb0Zha1diNUd3UDBfVA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPMEpURFJ6ekdaVGFCbHZGTV9KbHZVSk1uUUo5ZU1CekVSMTN4eklabVpuOWtvc3pTNHc0QzM3emxBOFJXTkgyaFotZTZKM3RTeU5HTVZsb1ZCM2ZrV1FlLVFzdTNmVWZHaGd5RnBVTEFZMk1OTk55NjBvdkxjeEIwZUdYa3g1empI?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Japan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOSXEtMVRFVFhUaG0tbHlNNjlSWElYOEVKQnBnamkzQzdIbXZWcTFoTDg4NXViQ1VEVnpIV0lDZEl2SFVvWVFLT3Y0V21FbVY2Q0FVTEhQTVVjS1JYUzFqMXBZVTJnSkl4OGdMZWJWMWVTeVJtVzVkbnFFcFRxZ3J1ZFpB?oc=5&quot;&gt;IndraStra Global&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/arti